          "author": "Sesame Street",
          "description": "There’s a first time for everything, even for your friends from Sesame Street! In “A Collection of Firsts,” little learners join Elmo, Grover, Zoe, Abby, and many other friends as they navigate through twelve brand-new experiences: using the potty, their first day of school, a visit to the doctor, and many more of life’s “firsts.”",
